      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "莱茵力量凭借她那稀世的感受力，\n能够将实力十二分地发挥出来。\n但是，勇敢之心却没能做到。其原因是？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7756ec99a2aa5c0d2bc013a2e1efe1ae05d98735199efd63b3953bcb020d8905",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        95,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/95/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4252f2b2b25f1a8dbf00167",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要掌握比赛的主导权，不仅要维持住速度，\n还要有持续向前的力量，\n时刻留意其他赛马娘的思考能力――",
      "source_fingerprint": "05d730f48ff4ad84016f1d849f7c0e25b41cd130d6c509c0084533901bca6185",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        96,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/96/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b0cd7a800980a87c4c9a66b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就能发挥出十二分实力，与力量并驾齐驱！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f59fc3ec138ca14053a44b3cdd883780ff49698cf13be9f2efd28b511ada82a9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        97,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/97/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a44e1519e6134796beb1acb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "错综复杂的要素交织在一起，\n就会比普通的奔跑更消耗耐力。既然如此，\n如果能比现在消耗得更少地奔跑的话――",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3480a608691eb13435bd89146fb0d92a507dd67fd0974ba031e64477b95d7a0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        97,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/97/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12dbcc92f2fb5cd739529b6c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "勇敢之心",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a26c04a8af8557f331ed7076671e2fce274ed0afd52fdd6e88b73fe92f7c8e9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        98,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/98/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a0dfbdb96455069b2f67dbc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……原来如此。",
      "source_fingerprint": "847512af8df432004e165b8ac86262c0a70499edaf452b98b84a837d19c05ce8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        98,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/98/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7adbfeddd459bb1db42c2708",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "…………你愿意相信我吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bdaea6260327fbc6e8bc480a0ab800fbe6756978568940219876f3ae3718bd3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        99,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/99/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:265af69579101524adec4181",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "…………你愿意相信我吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6bdaea6260327fbc6e8bc480a0ab800fbe6756978568940219876f3ae3718bd3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112114.json",
      "json_path": [
