    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59d30be5a4fd9db4dc947409",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "勇敢之心",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a26c04a8af8557f331ed7076671e2fce274ed0afd52fdd6e88b73fe92f7c8e9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        99,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/99/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2dfd2d83e84d28cc1f63afef",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "可是，要怎么抑制消耗呢？\n你现在也并非有了想法对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f307998e848cca5576bb9460b4bc9657e38332a938a9b51c866c75eb32c7ff81",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        99,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/99/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:951bfc13c0213054053919c0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "勇敢之心为了取胜而寻求改变。\n然而我得出的结论是――为了赢，\n反而应该发挥她原本的强项。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d67a2c5296da92c369f3bb66e9edc616392eadae08fcc3a15176b4ff48f7514",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3a4eb6786a37b0061635728",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "可是，如果持续向前突进，\n为了维持速度等因素，耐力的消耗会很大。\n如此一来，宝贵的优势便荡然无存。\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "10e11cfe8d138dab072a3241def54ea956be154e3ce2390309695ee227b1d4d0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7008756a4c610289f49a6cd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "信念",
      "source_fingerprint": "babc42f10899ba2983c282d2f8342f6be76bc34bf88a966dcd72326d68a1269d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b002a625c10e78a33564576a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "………………。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ae79d1cd69137180328e0fcbc1686701893bfe049aa0288e9759633f827b906",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abe55ab3bac6803d8dda6b50",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（她们身上――有“勇心”的感觉）",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e7cd129d0cbd50ae3cf6edb855b2ac974321e8df7f2fa68dee4a04b27cd5fca",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6a6beff7be21d3369c66331",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "信念曾问鼎『短途马锦标』『高松宫纪念』。\n同时，她也是名声远扬的坚实的sprinter。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a2224bce11861385c51f2eae7128667a4b1ded1856d7301b9fdd19e4a01af04",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d7398325023d8b29ac0d704",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（……实际去看看吧）",
      "source_fingerprint": "d84c395875ec77b077d0d6403ce332486bff0dacc5d6b1c92ec883720321899f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:166f1308a34380b5a418ea88",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她们各有各的个性和强项。\n但不知为何――从她们身上，\n我强烈地感受到了与勇心跑法类似的印象。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a6d51ef03dd36d17a75507d04849c5cccd8add17b79d4f22b4a8c11b2775061",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35d801628edb1dd35055e0a4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（好快……！而且――“速度没掉”）",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9df96296cede2ee3abe35206b11f90ddeb7b49601baba9f0628085467b0d9d7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcfd145feea7d0711a42a838",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "信念",
      "source_fingerprint": "babc42f10899ba2983c282d2f8342f6be76bc34bf88a966dcd72326d68a1269d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1452b11af6c20ad589100ad",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呼……、哈啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "41a2abf80399b820f758b20b85d340ce8cf7b75a913686e46f887b171ec1c37f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a112a6a4a8b26ae85d92a5a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（她没有消耗过多体力，就能跑完全程）",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c6549bbf3364a8222e4b04fec9860821b67bdeaf922015847655e21a7a1b058",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f98980e873b7b3f72943c731",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "持续高速奔跑是很难的。\n通常体力会跟不上，最后失速――\n但是，她不一样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e3340e6b4451ec041126183d9d68442f5d443dd557b91540d99bd63ae3319e9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:263cf22387807f839087646f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而且这一点，其他孩子同样能做到。\n虽然绝不是说她们的耐力有多么充沛，\n但是她们都巧妙地控制住了体力的消耗程度。",
      "source_fingerprint": "171452be3a3846547b6ca2436dad4f0f2db1d10d72fa8ffaab5992f61e32cbd4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b70ae77d74d1e1fd1f4a3ec1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如果，勇敢之心能把她们的技术学来的话――",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fc2a49fc2c12ee8e63d87066ebe309262127dd2c8bd72ee301a1946eeab2f46",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112115.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f419c9a2ef3e2991c4e95d5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "信念",
      "source_fingerprint": "babc42f10899ba2983c282d2f8342f6be76bc34bf88a966dcd72326d68a1269d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1112/storytimeline_501112115.json",
      "json_path": [
